<title>UK: Northern buys Scottish Pride UHT business.</title>
<headline>Northern buys Scottish Pride UHT business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food producer Northern Foods Plc said on Friday that it has bought the Scottish Pride UHT milk business of Scottish Pride Ltd, currently in receivership, for eight million stg in cash.</p>
<p>Receivers were appointed in February to Scottish Pride Holdings Plc's two main trading subsidiaries, Scottish Pride Ltd and Scottish Pride Foods Ltd.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
